    "Freshness": {
      "comment": "Dashboard TSB-based freshness label, shown when sleep tracking is unavailable\nDashboard freshness label, shown when sleep tracking is unavailable\nSheet title for freshness (TSB)",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Freshness"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fraîcheur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Freshness derives from your Training Stress Balance: TSB = CTL − ATL, where CTL is your 42-day chronic load and ATL your 7-day acute load. A positive TSB means your recent training is lighter than your baseline (you're fresh); a negative TSB means accumulated fatigue. Source: Coggan/Banister Performance Management Chart.": {
      "comment": "Freshness calculation explanation",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Freshness derives from your Training Stress Balance: TSB = CTL − ATL, where CTL is your 42-day chronic load and ATL your 7-day acute load. A positive TSB means your recent training is lighter than your baseline (you're fresh); a negative TSB means accumulated fatigue. Source: Coggan/Banister Performance Management Chart."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La fraîcheur dérive de ton Training Stress Balance : TSB = CTL − ATL, où le CTL représente ta charge chronique sur 42 jours et l'ATL ta charge aiguë sur 7 jours. Un TSB positif signifie que ton entraînement récent est plus léger que ta référence (tu es frais) ; un TSB négatif indique une fatigue accumulée. Source : Performance Management Chart de Coggan/Banister."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Freshness reflects how rested your body is for hard training. It compares your recent (7-day) and long-term (42-day) training loads — a sleep-independent indicator used when sleep tracking isn't available.": {
      "comment": "Freshness description",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Freshness reflects how rested your body is for hard training. It compares your recent (7-day) and long-term (42-day) training loads — a sleep-independent indicator used when sleep tracking isn't available."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La fraîcheur reflète à quel point ton corps est reposé pour un entraînement intense. Elle compare ta charge récente (7 jours) et à long terme (42 jours) — un indicateur indépendant du sommeil utilisé quand le suivi du sommeil n'est pas disponible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Frontiers in Physiology · 2019": {
      "comment": "HRV source 1",
