    "The information provided in this app is for educational and informational purposes only. It is not intended as a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Always seek the advice of your physician or other qualified health provider with any questions you may have regarding a medical condition.\n\nThe health metrics and recommendations in this app are based on published scientific research and general guidelines. Individual results may vary, and what is considered \"normal\" or \"optimal\" can differ based on age, fitness level, and health status.\n\nIf you experience any concerning symptoms or changes in your health metrics, please consult with a qualified healthcare professional.": {
      "comment": "Medical disclaimer text explaining the app is for educational purposes only",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The information provided in this app is for educational and informational purposes only. It is not intended as a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Always seek the advice of your physician or other qualified health provider with any questions you may have regarding a medical condition.\n\nThe health metrics and recommendations in this app are based on published scientific research and general guidelines. Individual results may vary, and what is considered \"normal\" or \"optimal\" can differ based on age, fitness level, and health status.\n\nIf you experience any concerning symptoms or changes in your health metrics, please consult with a qualified healthcare professional."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les informations fournies dans cette application le sont uniquement à des fins éducatives et informatives. Elles ne remplacent pas un avis médical professionnel, un diagnostic ou un traitement. Consulte toujours ton médecin ou un autre professionnel de santé qualifié pour toute question concernant un problème médical.\n\nLes métriques de santé et les recommandations de cette application reposent sur des recherches scientifiques publiées et sur des directives générales. Les résultats individuels peuvent varier, et ce qui est considéré comme « normal » ou « optimal » peut différer selon l'âge, le niveau de forme et l'état de santé.\n\nSi tu ressens des symptômes préoccupants ou si tu constates des changements dans tes métriques de santé, consulte un professionnel de santé qualifié."
          }
        }
      }
    },
