            "value": "Tu pourras autoriser l'accès plus tard dans Réglages. Certaines fonctionnalités ne seront pas disponibles sans HealthKit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You haven't run in %lld days. A light jog could help maintain your fitness.": {
      "comment": "Inactivity reminder recommendation",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu n'as pas couru depuis %lld jours. Un footing léger pourrait entretenir ta forme."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're %@%% ahead of last week! See your full progress.": {
      "comment": "Weekly progress notification body with positive change",
      "localizations": {
